# On 28's end save (party: Darmanitan 68, Pansage, Blitzle, Unfezant (Fly), Tepig, Sawk; bag: Master Ball, Ultra Ball x10):
# a Strength carrier (Conkeldurr (534) lv 50: Strength 70, Hammer Arm 359, Stone Edge 444) for the Guidance Chamber's
# boulder in Tepig's slot (scr 0867 script 1: Cmd116 0x46)
party-set 4 534 50 70 359 444
# Mistralton Cave 2F (zone 334), one tile below the Guidance Chamber's stairs (zone_event 334 warp 1 (17,12) 3x1).
# set-location keeps the saved zone's (136's) objects, so the chamber is entered by its warp, which loads its own.
location 334 18 0 13
